{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "ACP 智能体配置已经更改，请等待会话释放后重试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ACP agent configuration changed. Wait for the session to close, then try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在「设置 → 智能体」中添加或启用智能体。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add or enable an agent in Settings → Agents first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文件改动\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "File changes\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent 历史已删除。原有记录可只读查看。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent history was deleted. The local record is read-only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话当前无法删除远端历史。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The agent history cannot be deleted for this session right now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法断开 ACP 会话。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Could not disconnect the ACP session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "远端历史已删除，但本地状态未能保存。请重试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent history was deleted. The local state could not be saved. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一执行实例的清理未确认，不能建立新连接。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cleanup of the previous instance is unconfirmed. A new connection cannot be started."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次运行已中断。仅恢复历史和草稿，没有恢复推理或执行队列。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The previous run was interrupted. History and drafts were restored. Inference and queued tasks were not resumed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交互回复结果不明，请停止任务并核对运行时状态。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The interaction reply could not be confirmed. Stop the task and check the runtime status."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仍有未完成的控制请求，不能确认停止。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A control request is still pending. The stop cannot be confirmed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话尚未连接。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session is not connected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话已不可用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session is no longer available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话连接已变化，请重试模型查询。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session connection has changed. Try loading the models again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止结果尚未确认。请结束受管进程。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The stop could not be confirmed. End the managed processes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史会话" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Historical Session"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史工作目录与当前位置不同。旧会话可只读查看；请在当前位置新建会话。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The session’s historical working directory differs from the current one. You can browse the old session read-only or start a new session in the current location."
