      }
    },
    "该 ACP 会话无法恢复。请新建会话继续，原有历史可只读查看。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This ACP session cannot be resumed. Start a new session to continue. The existing history is available to read."
