    "该会话有未核实的发送记录。请先核对执行结果，避免重复操作。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This session has unconfirmed deliveries. Check the run results before sending again to avoid duplicate actions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请从审批超时中断处继续任务。先核对已完成的工作与当前状态，再处理剩余事项。需要审批时，请重新发起审批。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Continue the task that was interrupted by an approval timeout. First check the work already completed and the current state, then handle the remaining work. If approval is needed, request it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先处理会话草稿。" : {
      "localizations" : {
